# Misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# Documentation. The repo ships exactly four documents, all at the root; every
# other markdown file is a working note (plan.md, docs/*, per-package READMEs)
# and stays local. The negations use a leading slash so they match only the root
# copies — an unanchored "!README.md" would also un-ignore apps/*/README.md.
*.md
!/README.md
!/architecture.md
!/security.md
!/credentials.md

# Repo-root design-mockup folder only. Anchored with a leading slash so it does
# NOT also match apps/portal/src/components/ui/ — Git ignores are case-insensitive
# on Windows/macOS, so an unanchored "UI/" silently hid the whole ui component lib.
/UI/
glasss/